# REQ-005: Conversation Management
**Priority:** Must Have
**Effort:** Low
**Risk:** Low
**Depends On:** REQ-001, REQ-003
---
## User Story
As an external partner developer,
I need my conversation history to persist across pages and views within my session, and to be clearable on demand or on browser close,
So that I can continue a conversation naturally without losing context, and start fresh when I choose.
**Acceptance Criteria:**
- [ ] Conversation history persists across page navigation within the same browser session
- [ ] Conversation history persists between widget and full-page views within the same session
- [ ] An explicit "Clear conversation" button is available in both the widget and full-page view
- [ ] Clicking "Clear conversation" immediately resets the conversation to a clean state (confirmation prompt shown before clearing)
- [ ] Closing the browser clears the conversation — no history persists on next visit
