## Dimension 2: Information Governance
### Applicable Guardrails
- **IG-001:** Data Minimisation — conversation data held in sessionStorage only, not persisted server-side
### GDPR Articles
- **Article 6 Lawful Basis:** N/A — no server-side personal data storage for conversation content
- **Article 9 Special Category:** N/A
### Data Handling Requirements
- **Data Categories:** Conversation messages (non-personal in most cases)
- **Data Subjects:** External partner developers
- **Retention Period:** Session only — cleared on browser close
- **Data Minimisation:** No conversation data written to server; sessionStorage scoped to tab/window
