## Dimension 3: Security
### Applicable Guardrails
- **SEC-001:** TLS encryption in transit for all HTTP
- **WSEC-006a:** encodeURIComponent() for any user-supplied URL values
### Security Requirements
- **Authentication:** EMIS-X authentication required (inherited from REQ-001, REQ-003)
- **Authorisation:** Authenticated EMIS-X users only
- **Encryption in Transit:** TLS 1.2+ for all HTTP
- **Encryption at Rest:** N/A — conversation data not persisted server-side; sessionStorage used client-side only
- **Storage:** sessionStorage (not localStorage) — scoped to tab/window, cleared on browser close
